== Administrator asigna PlatformSuperAdmin (debe 400)
### POST /rbac/roles {"userId":"4ea43e73-f5c2-46d2-95de-c0f1c4f75fdc","role":"platform_super_admin"} (as USER_A_ADMIN)
HTTP 400
{"message":["role: Only organization roles can be assigned here"],"error":"Bad Request","statusCode":400}
== Operator intenta asignarse Administrator
### POST /rbac/roles {"userId":"6dfaccd5-f1b5-41fd-8082-a9ce735146f2","role":"administrator"} (as USER_A_LOW)
HTTP 403
{"message":"Insufficient role for this operation","error":"Forbidden","statusCode":403}
