### POST /rbac/roles {"userId":"5f70bacb-0771-441c-9443-e33d9d34b6fd","role":"administrator"} (as AUDITOR_A)
HTTP 403
{"message":"Insufficient role for this operation","error":"Forbidden","statusCode":403}
### POST /animals {"name":"x","species":"dog"} (as AUDITOR_A)
HTTP 403
{"message":"Insufficient role for this operation","error":"Forbidden","statusCode":403}
